\n  - Optional links to official calendars and enrollment pages\\\\n- Dues (resident-only; sign-in required)\\\\n  - Information only: amounts, due dates, how to pay offline (e.g., mail-in address, dropbox location)\\\\n  - Downloadable forms or instructions as PDFs (if needed)\\\\n  - Clear note that online payments are not accepted on the site\\\\n- Annual Meetings (resident-only; sign-in required)\\\\n  - Meeting schedule, agendas, minutes, and any recordings/links\\\\n  - Archive of previous years’ materials\\\\n- News & Events (resident-only; sign-in required)\\\\n  - Simple posts/updates only (no calendar/RSVP)\\\\n  - Chronological feed with tags (e.g., maintenance, safety, landscaping)\\\\n\\\\nMember access and onboarding:\\\\n- Request Access page (public): short form collects name, property address/unit, email, and optional proof of residency\\\\n- Admin approval workflow:\\\\n  - Admin reviews submissions against the resident list\\\\n  - Admin creates/approves the member in Squarespace Member Areas and assigns access to the resident-only area\\\\n  - Automated invite email sent by Squarespace to set password\\\\n- Offboarding: When a resident moves, admin removes their access in Member Areas\\\\n\\\\nNavigation and IA (information architecture):\\\\n- Top nav: Home, Legal Docs, Schools, Contact Us, Sign In / Request Access\\\\n- After sign-in, residents also see: Dues, Annual Meetings, News & Events\\\\n- Footer: HOA name, contact email, basic disclaimer, privacy note\\\\n\\\\nDesign and accessibility:\\\\n- Clean, simple Squarespace template with high-contrast colors and large, legible fonts\\\\n- Mobile-responsive by default\\\\n- Alt text for images; headings structured for screen readers; target WCAG AA\\\\n\\\\nContent management (no-code workflows):\\\\n- News & Events updates: Create a new post, add title/body, optional attachment/PDF, publish\\\\n- Annual Meetings updates: Upload agenda/minutes PDFs and add short summaries\\\\n- Legal Docs updat